{"version":1,"key":"card:296","content":{"id":296,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"42aecee8-4f5e-46f1-a487-1418656c5a4a","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise.all"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 接收一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对象组成的数组，返回一个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，只有当数组中的所有 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 都 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"resolved"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 后，返回的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 才会变为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"resolved"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 状态，并且将所有 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 传递的结果封装为数组传递下去"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"8796ee7e-4b53-4151-9a8d-3b2c7fdb5446","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"21e6dbb3-7627-4de8-95aa-47dd0a7d6cd5","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const promise1 = new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    resolve(1);\n  }, 1000);\n});\n\nconst promise2 = Promise.resolve(2);\n\nPromise.all([promise1, promise2]).then((results) => {\n  console.log(results); // 1s 后打印 [ 1, 2 ]\n});","collabId":"a9f15c7c-9bf8-48ee-8261-4b19cfce22da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0215861b-f08e-456b-9c47-2b3cac26e8fb","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"一旦数组中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 有任一个变为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"rejected"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，返回的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就会变为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"rejected"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 状态"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"dcc3e2e2-788b-46df-803c-57961eb62576","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"3b98ec2e-df5d-4932-8845-475df76df350","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let promise1 = new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    resolve(1);\n  }, 1000);\n});\n\n// rejected 状态的 Promise\nlet promise2 = Promise.reject(2);\n\nPromise.all([promise1, promise2])\n  .then((results) => {\n    console.log(results);\n  })\n  .catch((err) => {\n    console.log(err); // 2，reject传递的参数\n  });","collabId":"5fb78ad7-ca82-4876-9842-49388b8532c4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"2e5fbb4e-49f9-45f8-b7a2-d6e32fb538ec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"all"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 要么一起执行成功，要么全部失败，我们拿不到部分成功的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 结果。"}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Promise"],"createTime":1692197991631,"updateTime":1743303640424,"linkedCards":[{"id":285,"target":{"key":"card:285","type":"card","id":285},"summary":"JavaScript 是单线程的，为了不阻塞线程，很多方法都是异步的，通过回调函数的形式来处理函数结果，这就会带来一个问题，当回调特别多时，代码的可读性急剧下降 getUser(function(user) { getOrders(user...","tags":["JavaScript/Promise"]},{"id":297,"target":{"key":"card:297","type":"card","id":297},"summary":"Promise.all 可以等待多个异步任务执行完成，其返回一个 Promise ，只有这些异步任务全部执行成功时，返回的 Promise 才是 resolved 的，否则一旦一个 rejected ，其结果就是 rejected 的，但是...","tags":["JavaScript/Promise"]},{"id":338,"target":{"key":"card:338","type":"card","id":338},"summary":"在执行多个 Promise 时，我们一般是使用 Promise.all 来同时并发执行多个 Promise ，但是在资源有限的情况下，我们需要控制同时执行的 Promise 的数量，可以通过 p-limit 这个库来做到这一点。 安装： n...","tags":["JavaScript/三方库/p-limit"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640424}}